                       "reason":  "858f1ac7 moved the probe onto mandatory production arrival finalization; fix06_28 then sealed immutable room/event/route provenance and active-only turn facts without adding schema fields.",
                       "proof":  "The pre-refresh contract produced byte-identical same-seed twins, exact no-op behavior for inactive world-sequence and Crew seams, and zero Crew trust. Git ancestry proves the prior fixture predates 858f1ac7, which replaced raw next_environment calls with generate_and_finalize/travel_and_finalize. The accepted capture is from 24f19ef7 after the same production finalization path gained immutable source provenance; all two-seed/five-checkpoint byte counts and hashes are retained exactly."
